{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24286","headline":"韦七自太子宾客再除秘书监以长句贺而饯之 · 白居易","name":"韦七自太子宾客再除秘书监以长句贺而饯之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离筵莫怆且同欢，共贺新恩拜旧官。\n屈就商山伴麋鹿，好归芸阁狎鵷鸾。\n落星石上苍苔古，画鹤厅前白露寒。\n老监姓名应在壁，相思试爲拂尘看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24286.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24286","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}